        {
          "text": "Yesu ŵatite kuti, “Une nayice ku cilambo capasi kuti ulemwa wa ŵandu uwonecele pakulanguka, kuti ŵali ŵangalola alole nipo ŵali ŵakulola aŵe ŵangalola.” ",
