              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afalisi ŵiŵam'wandicile Yesu ŵampikene jwalakwe ali mkuŵeceta yeleyi nipo ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ana yakuwona wawo akugopolela kuti uwe soni tuli ŵangalola?”",
